# S08-T04: Epic `targetApp` Field

## Objective

Epic declares which app receives Accept write-back (`apps/{targetApp}/planning/`).

## App-agent preflight (MANDATORY)

- [ ] `explain("work-control")` — persistence section
- [ ] `get-file` — repo schema, epic API routes, `useEpics.ts`

## Implementation

- [ ] Migration: `wc_epics.target_app TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'work-control'`
- [ ] Repo layer + API: create/patch epic `targetApp`
- [ ] Validate: `apps/{targetApp}/` exists OR allowlist `['work-control','todo']`
- [ ] UI: target app badge/selector on Epics column (default `work-control`)
- [ ] ROOT agents: include `targetApp` on proposals (default `work-control`)

## Done when

- [ ] `bun run db:migrate` succeeds
- [ ] Epic PATCH persists `targetApp`
- [ ] `bun run test` green
